  "rules": [
    "Only confirmed details may be labeled user_confirmed.",
    "Aesthetic or precise body values not visibly measurable are proposals until approved.",
    "B/W/H measurements when used describe neutral clothed character construction and are not a request for sexualized body depiction.",
    "Do not create an approved game actor from a draft with missing art.",
    "Do not overwrite an approved visual master with a guessed rendering.",
    "Upper-arm/forearm/thigh/calf dimensions and facial landmark placements must be explicitly represented, but remain null until grounded or designed and approved.",
    "Every character must record visual production styles, expression baseline, body/head yaw and gaze; these are art-production fields rather than new biography."
  ],
